en:
Casting |cffffffffEndbringer|r now marks the ground beneath you as your |cffffffffGravesite|r for $804722d.

Direct critical strikes made against enemies within a |cffffffffGravesite|r now deals ${$300979m1*$<scalingbp>+$AP*0.36} Shadow damage.

@ext:This effect is still active while in another Reaper's |cffffffffGravesite|r.:ext@
